      "briefing": "## The rule\n\n- Read the list **top to bottom**.\n- The **first entry that matches** decides.\n- Stop there. Later entries are never checked.\n\n## Example\n\n> 10 deny tcp any any eq 25\n> 20 permit tcp 192.168.7.0/24 any eq 25\n\nA TCP packet from 192.168.7.4 to port 25 matches entry 10 first, so it is **denied**. Entry 20 would also match, but it is never reached.\n\n## Tip\n\n- The same entries in a different order can give a different answer.\n- Packets dive a little faster now."
