      "briefing": "## The hidden last entry\n\n- Every list ends with an invisible **deny everything**.\n- A packet that matches nothing is **denied**. Shoot it.\n\n## Watch the protocol\n\n- **tcp** never matches udp or icmp packets.\n- An entry with a port never matches icmp, which has no port.\n- **ip** matches any protocol.\n\n## Example\n\n> 10 permit tcp 192.168.9.0/24 any eq 22\n\nA UDP packet from 192.168.9.4 to port 22 has the wrong protocol. Nothing matches, so the hidden deny drops it.\n\n## Tip\n\n- This is the fastest level."
